{"title":"Ember Salamander","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 59 Salamander that attacks with burn (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 4 times (1.8% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ember-salamander\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ember-salamander?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>128</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ember-salamander?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>275</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ember-salamander?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>818</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ember-salamander?lv=60\">Lv 60 <span>758</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ember-salamander?lv=57\" title=\"Pick level 57\"><td><b>57</b></td><td>406</td><td>35.9</td><td>2,850</td><td class=\"muted\">1,218 · 50.3 · 8,550</td><td>128</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ember-salamander?lv=58\" title=\"Pick level 58\"><td><b>58</b></td><td>423</td><td>36.4</td><td>2,900</td><td class=\"muted\">1,269 · 51 · 8,700</td><td>275</td><td>in the wilds around 307, -1068</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ember-salamander?lv=59\" title=\"Pick level 59\"><td><b>59</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>818</td><td>in the wilds around 294, -1077</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ember-salamander?lv=60\" title=\"Pick level 60\"><td><b>60</b></td><td>455</td><td>37.5</td><td>3,000</td><td class=\"muted\">1,365 · 52.5 · 9,000</td><td>758</td><td>in the wilds around 302, -1154</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 42 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 57 recorded drops, 3,620 total, 16–550 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×16–550</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"salamander-crest\" title=\"Salamander Crest - in 34 of 42 looted corpses, 32 recorded drops, 68 total, 1–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/2b93fad57bcaa0db1d86.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Salamander Crest</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.2<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bones\" title=\"Bones - in 5 of 42 looted corpses, 5 recorded drops, 5 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c29e1ebe544dbfedca68.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bones</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/8<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 2 of 42 looted corpses, 2 recor